msgctxt "help:carrier.selection,from_country:"
msgid ""
"Apply only when shipping from this country.\n"
"Leave empty for any countries."
msgstr ""
"អនុវត្តតែនៅពេលដឹកជញ្ជូនចេញពីប្រទេសនេះ។\n"
